1
00:00:39,712 --> 00:00:45,600
=My Loong=

2
00:00:46,016 --> 00:00:48,832
=Episode 8=

3
00:00:50,920 --> 00:00:51,799
What do you

4
00:00:52,640 --> 00:00:53,479
want to learn next?

5
00:00:56,320 --> 00:00:56,960
Chunfeng Pavilion.

6
00:00:59,280 --> 00:01:01,359
What on earth
is going through your head?

7
00:01:01,439 --> 00:01:02,320
I forgot to ask you,

8
00:01:02,320 --> 00:01:03,399
why were you there today?

9
00:01:03,640 --> 00:01:04,439
Someone told me

10
00:01:04,959 --> 00:01:07,040
that I could learn a lot
at Chunfeng Pavilion.

11
00:01:07,359 --> 00:01:08,480
I just wanted to know

12
00:01:08,799 --> 00:01:11,159
how to make you like normal people.

13
00:01:16,760 --> 00:01:17,760
Those things

14
00:01:19,159 --> 00:01:20,920
are intimate matters between couples.

15
00:01:21,760 --> 00:01:23,480
If it's so shameful to talk about,

16
00:01:24,719 --> 00:01:26,480
why are those women so brazen?

17
00:01:28,480 --> 00:01:29,519
They aren't brazen.

18
00:01:31,439 --> 00:01:32,319
They have no choice.

19
00:01:33,319 --> 00:01:34,000
In this world,

20
00:01:34,400 --> 00:01:36,359
there are too many shackles
placed on women.

21
00:01:36,760 --> 00:01:37,760
One wrong step,

22
00:01:39,359 --> 00:01:40,719
and there's no turning back.

23
00:01:41,599 --> 00:01:42,920
Many of them

24
00:01:43,159 --> 00:01:43,840
were forced

25
00:01:43,840 --> 00:01:44,920
or left with no way out.

26
00:01:45,200 --> 00:01:46,680
What's worse is the men,

27
00:01:47,519 --> 00:01:49,079
looking down on them with contempt

28
00:01:49,280 --> 00:01:50,599
while flocking to them.

29
00:02:01,840 --> 00:02:02,840
My life

30
00:02:07,120 --> 00:02:08,759
was also never mine to choose.

31
00:02:10,319 --> 00:02:11,639
Just like my name,

32
00:02:13,039 --> 00:02:14,400
I longed for the mountain moon

33
00:02:14,919 --> 00:02:16,400
and to wander far and wide,

34
00:02:17,759 --> 00:02:19,360
yet I was always trapped at home.

35
00:02:32,560 --> 00:02:33,800
Once, I thought

36
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:36,319
someone truly loved me,

37
00:02:37,240 --> 00:02:38,599
and I chose him for life.

38
00:02:40,800 --> 00:02:42,400
Later, I found that all he had to offer

39
00:02:43,919 --> 00:02:45,400
were these paintings.

40
00:02:50,120 --> 00:02:51,840
Then I was sacrificed to you

41
00:02:52,439 --> 00:02:53,759
and became your bride.

42
00:02:55,439 --> 00:02:56,960
None of those was my choice.

43
00:02:59,479 --> 00:03:02,639
True intimacy in this world

44
00:03:04,319 --> 00:03:06,520
is a choice made from the heart.

45
00:03:10,199 --> 00:03:11,240
Confused, aren't you?

46
00:03:19,159 --> 00:03:20,240
Do you like them?

47
00:03:22,360 --> 00:03:23,319
Paintings are lifeless.

48
00:03:24,039 --> 00:03:24,840
But I am real.

49
00:03:26,719 --> 00:03:27,360
Let's go.

50
00:03:47,488 --> 00:03:52,063
♪Bridal red blankets
ninety-nine miles of frost♪

51
00:03:52,838 --> 00:03:57,335
♪She looks back,
wind and rain veiling the moon♪

52
00:04:00,574 --> 00:04:05,696
♪Beneath the abyss, golden eyes open♪

53
00:04:07,039 --> 00:04:08,039
It's so beautiful.

54
00:04:09,152 --> 00:04:10,516
♪Refusing to forget♪

55
00:04:14,182 --> 00:04:18,959
♪The mortal world's rules
are cruel and absurd♪

56
00:04:19,510 --> 00:04:21,300
♪He cannot learn them♪

57
00:04:21,300 --> 00:04:24,435
♪Yet carves her name upon his heart♪

58
00:04:27,587 --> 00:04:29,911
♪One name on a wooden plaque♪

59
00:04:29,911 --> 00:04:32,274
♪Swaying high upon the branch♪

60
00:04:32,736 --> 00:04:35,516
♪Waiting for snow and wind
to speak for him♪

61
00:04:35,516 --> 00:04:37,274
♪Their days ahead are long♪

62
00:04:39,808 --> 00:04:45,728
♪If fate tears us apart♪

63
00:04:50,519 --> 00:04:51,360
This is the imperial palace,

64
00:04:51,879 --> 00:04:53,399
where supreme power resides.

65
00:04:54,360 --> 00:04:55,600
A mortal's life or death

66
00:04:55,600 --> 00:04:57,439
hinges on a single word
from the ones within.

67
00:05:01,160 --> 00:05:02,439
Lizhi, we can't go there!

68
00:05:02,439 --> 00:05:06,144
♪I am a wound etched into your palm♪

69
00:05:06,464 --> 00:05:09,600
♪Cloud steps open,
where does the way home lie♪

70
00:05:09,792 --> 00:05:12,704
♪Scattering my divine soul
to gaze upon you for a lifetime♪

71
00:05:14,920 --> 00:05:15,480
Lizhi,

72
00:05:16,839 --> 00:05:17,720
before anyone notices,

73
00:05:17,720 --> 00:05:18,600
let's leave quickly.

74
00:05:24,040 --> 00:05:24,839
Who goes there,

75
00:05:24,959 --> 00:05:26,040
trespassing in the palace?

76
00:05:27,839 --> 00:05:28,600
Seize them!

77
00:05:47,712 --> 00:05:49,952
♪Ten years later,
the street carver opens shop again♪

78
00:05:49,952 --> 00:05:51,632
♪Those two wooden plaques
hang once more♪

79
00:05:51,632 --> 00:05:53,231
♪Someone ties a red string from behind♪

80
00:05:53,231 --> 00:05:55,053
♪Snow falls on shoulders,
growing old together♪

81
00:05:55,053 --> 00:05:56,794
♪The loong's song
leaves a legend in this realm♪

82
00:05:56,794 --> 00:05:58,435
♪Land and rivers as gifts,
wind and snow as adornment♪

83
00:05:58,435 --> 00:05:59,693
♪This time, no sacrifice,
no turning back♪

84
00:05:59,693 --> 00:06:01,606
♪Only with you,
I watch moonset and rising tides♪

85
00:06:11,160 --> 00:06:11,800
Lizhi,

86
00:06:12,160 --> 00:06:14,279
maybe we should leave. This place...

87
00:06:14,279 --> 00:06:15,399
Slow down, Your Highness.

88
00:06:17,079 --> 00:06:17,600
Hurry.

89
00:06:19,160 --> 00:06:19,839
Hurry up.

90
00:06:35,712 --> 00:06:40,128
(Zhu Su, Prince Qi)

91
00:07:01,079 --> 00:07:02,304
Your Highness, you mustn't.

92
00:07:03,199 --> 00:07:05,160
Th-This is the imperial throne.

93
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:07,800
Across this realm,

94
00:07:08,160 --> 00:07:10,199
what corner isn't under my rule?

95
00:07:10,439 --> 00:07:13,480
I just didn't expect the young emperor

96
00:07:14,360 --> 00:07:15,720
to have some guts,

97
00:07:16,199 --> 00:07:19,800
daring to send an imperial censor
into my domain.

98
00:07:21,040 --> 00:07:22,040
And those useless fools

99
00:07:22,639 --> 00:07:24,519
couldn't even handle
a simple matter like that.

100
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:27,560
(This is Zhu Heng's father,)

101
00:07:27,839 --> 00:07:28,959
(Zhu Su, Prince Qi.)

102
00:07:29,959 --> 00:07:31,600
(His Majesty sent an imperial censor?)

103
00:07:32,399 --> 00:07:33,199
(Could it be)

104
00:07:34,000 --> 00:07:36,040
(Master Wei Xun
protected by the Merchant Coalition?)

105
00:07:37,160 --> 00:07:37,920
In the capital,

106
00:07:38,879 --> 00:07:40,680
the young emperor has actually managed

107
00:07:41,000 --> 00:07:43,648
to raise a flock
of fearless imperial censors.

108
00:07:44,319 --> 00:07:45,560
They've been on my tail lately.

109
00:07:45,759 --> 00:07:47,839
I must remain in the capital

110
00:07:48,439 --> 00:07:50,040
to put them in their place personally.

111
00:07:52,360 --> 00:07:54,839
As for Heng's wedding,

112
00:07:55,160 --> 00:07:55,959
I

113
00:07:56,399 --> 00:07:57,800
won't be able to attend.

114
00:07:58,439 --> 00:08:00,079
The capital's stability comes first.

115
00:08:00,319 --> 00:08:02,360
The young lord
will understand your intentions.

116
00:08:03,199 --> 00:08:04,040
Understand?

117
00:08:06,560 --> 00:08:08,399
Right now, in that head of his,

118
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:10,600
besides that Yue girl,

119
00:08:11,399 --> 00:08:12,879
what else does he care about?

120
00:08:13,680 --> 00:08:16,160
I spent half my life at war

121
00:08:17,040 --> 00:08:18,319
and half my life scheming.

122
00:08:19,120 --> 00:08:19,720
Yet in the end,

123
00:08:19,720 --> 00:08:21,600
I ended up with such a worthless son.

124
00:08:24,040 --> 00:08:24,759
Fine.

125
00:08:26,639 --> 00:08:29,240
I'll sweep away all obstacles for him

126
00:08:31,040 --> 00:08:33,159
so he can sit securely on this throne.

127
00:08:33,519 --> 00:08:35,039
Is that chair really so comfortable?

128
00:08:38,840 --> 00:08:41,240
Everyone wants to sit on that throne,

129
00:08:41,799 --> 00:08:43,320
but once you're on it,

130
00:08:43,960 --> 00:08:46,639
thousands of eyes stare at you,

131
00:08:47,039 --> 00:08:48,200
just waiting to pull you down.

132
00:09:23,480 --> 00:09:24,000
Lizhi!

133
00:09:26,000 --> 00:09:26,840
Put me down.

134
00:09:27,879 --> 00:09:28,720
Lizhi!

135
00:09:33,088 --> 00:09:34,884
♪If the wind were a verb♪

136
00:09:35,279 --> 00:09:37,879
♪Blowing through my thoughts♪

137
00:09:38,320 --> 00:09:39,240
In this world,

138
00:09:40,519 --> 00:09:41,519
only what we won't do,

139
00:09:42,519 --> 00:09:43,559
never what others forbid.

140
00:09:44,480 --> 00:09:48,512
♪I flipped when we met in our youth♪

141
00:09:49,952 --> 00:09:54,614
♪I seek in the moonlight
for the rest of my life♪

142
00:09:55,488 --> 00:09:57,792
♪If love were a noun♪

143
00:09:57,952 --> 00:10:00,672
♪Woven with pain♪

144
00:10:01,248 --> 00:10:06,080
♪I softly murmur your name
between heartbeats♪

145
00:10:06,752 --> 00:10:12,416
♪As ripples stir
in the corner of our eyes♪

146
00:10:12,416 --> 00:10:19,648
♪Wherever our gazes meet,
passion settles♪

147
00:10:20,288 --> 00:10:23,040
♪Letting the longing in your eyes♪

148
00:10:23,040 --> 00:10:25,440
♪Take root after drowning♪

149
00:10:25,984 --> 00:10:31,040
♪Like a silent, unfeeling,
restrained kiss♪

150
00:10:44,384 --> 00:10:46,320
(Zhang Jin, Prefect Zhang's Son)

151
00:10:46,320 --> 00:10:48,120
Young General Yue didn't lie to me.

152
00:10:48,240 --> 00:10:49,120
You really are here.

153
00:10:49,320 --> 00:10:49,919
Go!

154
00:10:50,480 --> 00:10:51,399
Grab her!

155
00:10:55,759 --> 00:10:57,399
Zhang Jin, what are you doing here?

156
00:10:57,799 --> 00:11:00,279
Playing dumb with me, aren't you?

157
00:11:00,919 --> 00:11:02,720
Your aunt took my betrothal gift.

158
00:11:03,159 --> 00:11:04,440
I intended to marry you

159
00:11:04,440 --> 00:11:05,519
with the proper ceremony.

160
00:11:05,799 --> 00:11:06,559
Who knew

161
00:11:06,840 --> 00:11:08,480
you'd make up some "Loong Lord" nonsense

162
00:11:08,480 --> 00:11:09,440
to scare my men.

163
00:11:09,919 --> 00:11:11,759
Since you want to do this the hard way,

164
00:11:12,039 --> 00:11:14,120
I don't have to spare your dignity.

165
00:11:14,600 --> 00:11:15,879
Right here, right now,

166
00:11:16,480 --> 00:11:18,240
I'll make you mine.

167
00:11:19,000 --> 00:11:20,159
Let's see

168
00:11:20,159 --> 00:11:22,200
if that so-called Loong Lord

169
00:11:22,639 --> 00:11:23,679
will come to save you.

170
00:11:26,440 --> 00:11:27,040
Get her!

171
00:11:35,039 --> 00:11:35,600
Master,

172
00:11:36,440 --> 00:11:37,919
just beyond the bamboo grove ahead

173
00:11:38,480 --> 00:11:40,240
is the late Madam Yue's former retreat.

174
00:11:40,960 --> 00:11:42,840
The person you seek should be there.

175
00:11:43,600 --> 00:11:44,679
Are the gifts prepared?

176
00:11:45,320 --> 00:11:46,480
Following your orders,

177
00:11:46,960 --> 00:11:48,799
I had Master Qingfeng
paint them personally.

178
00:11:49,120 --> 00:11:51,960
But after finishing, he claimed

179
00:11:52,279 --> 00:11:53,720
such erotic art

180
00:11:53,919 --> 00:11:54,879
tarnished his name,

181
00:11:55,159 --> 00:11:56,200
trying to cut off his hands.

182
00:11:56,759 --> 00:11:57,720
- Did he?
- No.

183
00:11:58,039 --> 00:11:59,240
I knocked him out.

184
00:12:00,480 --> 00:12:01,120
Good.

185
00:12:02,200 --> 00:12:02,848
Master,

186
00:12:03,720 --> 00:12:04,360
perhaps

187
00:12:04,639 --> 00:12:06,240
you should let me go alone.

188
00:12:06,759 --> 00:12:08,519
That master has peculiar tastes.

189
00:12:08,960 --> 00:12:10,440
What if he harbors ill intentions

190
00:12:10,799 --> 00:12:11,759
toward you?

191
00:12:11,919 --> 00:12:13,039
Someone so talented

192
00:12:13,240 --> 00:12:15,240
is bound to be a bit odd.

193
00:12:16,159 --> 00:12:17,559
If I can win him over,

194
00:12:18,360 --> 00:12:20,559
what do a few quirks matter?

195
00:12:26,200 --> 00:12:26,919
I got you.

196
00:12:27,600 --> 00:12:28,840
You sure can run for a cripple.

197
00:12:33,559 --> 00:12:35,240
Don't try to push your luck!

198
00:12:35,679 --> 00:12:36,759
In all of Daizhou,

199
00:12:37,120 --> 00:12:38,039
who else but me

200
00:12:38,480 --> 00:12:40,000
would ever want a cripple like you?

201
00:12:40,320 --> 00:12:41,919
I'm just generous enough

202
00:12:42,039 --> 00:12:43,320
to take in a wretch like you!

203
00:12:44,000 --> 00:12:44,759
Let me go!

204
00:12:44,960 --> 00:12:46,000
Let you go?

205
00:12:46,159 --> 00:12:47,240
I came here today

206
00:12:47,240 --> 00:12:48,639
with no intention of letting you go.

207
00:12:48,639 --> 00:12:52,600
Besides, I've never had
a cripple before.

208
00:12:52,600 --> 00:12:53,200
Stop!

209
00:13:04,519 --> 00:13:05,679
Do you know who my father is?

210
00:13:05,679 --> 00:13:07,039
He is the Prefect of Daizhou!

211
00:13:11,039 --> 00:13:12,039
If you lay a hand on me,

212
00:13:12,159 --> 00:13:12,799
if you do,

213
00:13:12,799 --> 00:13:13,919
my father will make you pay!

214
00:13:19,399 --> 00:13:20,559
Lady Yue, are you all right?

215
00:13:21,679 --> 00:13:22,840
I-I'm fine.

216
00:13:27,840 --> 00:13:29,039
Leave the rest to us.

217
00:13:32,200 --> 00:13:32,799
Master?

218
00:13:33,159 --> 00:13:34,480
Master, wake up. Master?

219
00:13:35,519 --> 00:13:36,120
Master?

220
00:13:42,799 --> 00:13:43,320
Master.

221
00:13:49,639 --> 00:13:51,039
Thank you for saving me.

222
00:13:51,360 --> 00:13:52,080
Don't mention it.

223
00:13:53,159 --> 00:13:55,559
You clearly had the upper hand

224
00:13:55,559 --> 00:13:56,320
and handled it well.

225
00:13:56,759 --> 00:13:58,000
It seems I worried for nothing.

226
00:13:58,480 --> 00:13:59,279
You flatter me.

227
00:13:59,799 --> 00:14:01,960
Wild beasts roam this area often.

228
00:14:02,559 --> 00:14:03,200
For my safety,

229
00:14:03,519 --> 00:14:04,679
I set a few traps.

230
00:14:05,240 --> 00:14:06,360
I see.

231
00:14:11,559 --> 00:14:13,039
(She seems so delicate,)

232
00:14:13,879 --> 00:14:15,279
(yet she possesses such courage.)

233
00:14:17,480 --> 00:14:19,519
Lady Yue, that day at Chunfeng Pavilion,

234
00:14:19,519 --> 00:14:21,240
both of you saved my life.

235
00:14:21,240 --> 00:14:22,159
I am truly grateful.

236
00:14:22,519 --> 00:14:23,559
I came in person today

237
00:14:23,559 --> 00:14:24,399
to express my thanks.

238
00:14:25,440 --> 00:14:26,600
You've come at a bad time.

239
00:14:26,960 --> 00:14:28,159
They only stayed temporarily

240
00:14:28,360 --> 00:14:29,360
and aren't here now.

241
00:14:32,159 --> 00:14:32,800
It's fine.

242
00:14:37,240 --> 00:14:38,000
A small token

243
00:14:38,200 --> 00:14:38,919
of my respect.

244
00:14:43,120 --> 00:14:44,320
We saved your life,

245
00:14:44,879 --> 00:14:46,120
and you saved mine today.

246
00:14:46,639 --> 00:14:47,600
We are already even.

247
00:14:47,960 --> 00:14:49,039
These are too generous.

248
00:14:49,399 --> 00:14:51,320
That master values his peace.

249
00:14:51,600 --> 00:14:52,639
I wouldn't dare impose.

250
00:14:53,240 --> 00:14:54,320
But please,

251
00:14:54,320 --> 00:14:55,799
pass these gifts along on my behalf

252
00:14:56,039 --> 00:14:57,919
as a small gesture of my respect.

253
00:15:02,000 --> 00:15:02,720
I'm so sorry.

254
00:15:02,720 --> 00:15:03,440
Forgive me.

255
00:15:03,720 --> 00:15:04,288
It's fine.

256
00:15:23,399 --> 00:15:24,480
That's thoughtful of you.

257
00:15:24,759 --> 00:15:25,799
It's a misunderstanding.

258
00:15:26,399 --> 00:15:28,159
I will convey your kind regards.

259
00:15:28,559 --> 00:15:29,720
As for if he accepts them,

260
00:15:29,720 --> 00:15:30,919
that is not my decision.

261
00:15:31,639 --> 00:15:32,399
I...

262
00:15:33,759 --> 00:15:34,919
If there is nothing else,

263
00:15:35,159 --> 00:15:35,960
please leave.

264
00:15:36,120 --> 00:15:36,840
My humble home

265
00:15:37,240 --> 00:15:37,960
is fit for guests.

266
00:15:56,799 --> 00:15:57,600
Wangshu!

267
00:15:58,480 --> 00:15:59,000
Xingyao.

268
00:15:59,000 --> 00:16:00,039
Wangshu, you're back.

269
00:16:00,240 --> 00:16:00,840
Xingyao.

270
00:16:01,840 --> 00:16:02,600
What are these?

271
00:16:03,159 --> 00:16:03,799
Well...

272
00:16:21,600 --> 00:16:23,296
(The Spring Splendor Album)

273
00:16:38,759 --> 00:16:39,879
So,

274
00:16:40,320 --> 00:16:42,360
should we return these art books?

275
00:16:43,039 --> 00:16:43,720
Return them.

276
00:16:46,368 --> 00:16:50,943
♪Bridal red blankets
ninety-nine miles of frost♪

277
00:16:51,718 --> 00:16:56,215
♪She looks back,
wind and rain veiling the moon♪

278
00:16:59,454 --> 00:17:04,576
♪Beneath the abyss, golden eyes open♪

279
00:17:04,576 --> 00:17:07,915
♪A thousand-year trial
scorches the soul♪

280
00:17:07,915 --> 00:17:09,279
♪Refusing to forget♪

281
00:17:12,945 --> 00:17:17,722
♪The mortal world's rules
are cruel and absurd♪

282
00:17:18,273 --> 00:17:20,063
♪He cannot learn them♪

283
00:17:20,063 --> 00:17:23,198
♪Yet carves her name upon his heart♪

284
00:17:26,350 --> 00:17:28,674
♪One name on a wooden plaque♪

285
00:17:28,674 --> 00:17:31,037
♪Swaying high upon the branch♪

286
00:17:31,615 --> 00:17:34,279
♪Waiting for snow and wind
to speak for him♪

287
00:17:34,279 --> 00:17:36,037
♪Their days ahead are long♪
